{
  "name": "daxiang-zotero-tools",
  "type": "module",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Daxiang Zotero Tools — 自用 Zotero 插件（分类聚合 / 阅读状态 / 数据包导出 / 库体检 / 结构化字段 / 元数据清洗 / 更新检查 / 文献入库）",
  "config": {
    "addonName": "Daxiang Zotero Tools",
    "_comment_addonID": "插件 ID 与 addonRef 刻意保持不变：它们决定 Zotero 眼里的插件身份与首选项前缀（extensions.zotero.myzoterotools.*）。改了会让已装插件变成「另一个插件」，现有设置与状态标签全部变孤儿。显示名（addonName）与内部 ID 本来就可以不一致。",
    "addonID": "myzoterotools@personal.local",
    "addonRef": "myzoterotools",
    "addonInstance": "MyZoteroTools",
    "prefsPrefix": "extensions.zotero.myzoterotools"
  },
  "author": "leobba",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/leobba/Daxiang-zotero-tools",
  "_comment_repository": "zotero-plugin-scaffold 会无条件解析这里的 owner/repo，用来填 updateURL 与 xpiDownloadLink 里的 {{owner}}/{{repo}} 模板变量。所以【仓库地址只需要改这一处】。",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/leobba/Daxiang-zotero-tools.git"
  },
  "license": "AGPL-3.0-or-later",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "zotero-plugin serve",
    "build": "zotero-plugin build && tsc --noEmit",
    "lint:check": "prettier --check . && eslint .",
    "lint:fix": "prettier --write . && eslint . --fix",
    "test": "zotero-plugin test",
    "release": "zotero-plugin release",
    "release:patch": "zotero-plugin release patch -y",
    "release:minor": "zotero-plugin release minor -y",
    "release:major": "zotero-plugin release major -y"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "zotero-plugin-toolkit": "^6.0.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/chai": "^5.2.3",
    "@types/mocha": "^10.0.10",
    "@types/node": "^24.10.0",
    "@zotero-plugin/eslint-config": "^0.6.7",
    "chai": "^6.2.1",
    "eslint": "^9.39.2",
    "mocha": "^11.7.5",
    "prettier": "^3.7.4",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "zotero-plugin-scaffold": "^0.9.2",
    "zotero-types": "^4.1.3"
  },
  "_comment_overrides": "zotero-types 通过 git 依赖引用 pdfjs-dist / epubjs（github: 协议）。本机 GitHub git 通道不可达且 npm 12 默认 allow-git=none，故用嵌套 overrides 重定向到 npm 上的等价版本。注意：必须用嵌套写法（扁平写法对 epubjs 不生效），且首次安装前需删除上游锁文件。",
  "overrides": {
    "zotero-types": {
      "pdfjs-dist": "npm:pdfjs-dist@5.4.624",
      "epubjs": "npm:epubjs@0.3.93"
    }
  },
  "prettier": {
    "printWidth": 80,
    "tabWidth": 2,
    "endOfLine": "lf",
    "overrides": [
      {
        "files": [
          "*.xhtml"
        ],
        "options": {
          "htmlWhitespaceSensitivity": "css"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
